  "content": "<div><br></div><div><ul data-spread=\"false\" data-pm-slice=\"3 3 []\"><li data-label=\"•\" data-list-type=\"bullet\" data-spread=\"false\"><p><strong>Daterra Standard Mushroom Foraging rule:</strong> She rolls Survival. If environment is plentiful, Survival DC 1o. Normal places, DC12-14. Underdark usually DC15, 20, or higher.</p></li><li data-label=\"•\" data-list-type=\"bullet\" data-spread=\"false\"><p>If she beat the DC, for every 1 over the DC she can get 1 bingo chip. For every 3 over the DC she can get a rolled Special Mushroom (from Feywild or Underdark Rolltables). She can mix and match.</p></li></ul><div><br></div></div><div><table class=\"table\" id=\"addiction\" style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); --table-background-color: none; width: 678.8px; border-collapse: collapse; background: none 0% 0% / auto repeat scroll padding-box border-box rgb(255, 255, 255); border: thin solid rgb(164, 121, 68); margin: 1rem auto; border-spacing: 0px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; margin-inline: 0px; text-align: center; table-layout: fixed; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, Verdana, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px;\"><tbody style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"><tr style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(246, 241, 234);\"><th colspan=\"4\" style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 0.5em 1em; border: thin solid rgb(164, 121, 68); color: rgb(153, 0, 51); text-align: center;\"><p style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0.5rem 0px; line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Addiction</span></p></th></tr><tr 