-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 0.5em 1em; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0.5rem 0px; line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">High</span></p></td><td style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 0.5em 1em; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0.5rem 0px; line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">16</span></p></td><td style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 0.5em 1em; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0.5rem 0px; line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">2 days</span></p></td><td style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 0.5em 1em; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0.5rem 0px; line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">2 levels of Exhaustion initially, then 1 level Exhaustion each failed save after that</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); background-color: rgb(246, 241, 234);\"><td style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 0.5em 1em; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0.5rem 0px; line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Extreme</span></p></td><td style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 0.5em 1em; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0.5rem 0px; line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">20</span></p></td><td style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 0.5em 1em; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0.5rem 0px; line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">1 day</span></p></td><td style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 0.5em 1em; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0.5rem 0px; line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">3 levels of Exhaustion initially, then 1 level Exhaustion each failed save after that</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\"><td style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 0.5em 1em; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0.5rem 0px; line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">Vicious</span></p></td><td style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 0.5em 1em; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0.5rem 0px; line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">25</span></p></td><td style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 0.5em 1em; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0.5rem 0px; line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">1 day</span></p></td><td style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); padding: 0.5em 1em; text-align: left;\"><p style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0); margin: 0.5rem 0px; line-height: 1.4;\"><span style=\"user-select: text; scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(120, 46, 34) rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);\">4 levels of Exhaustion initially, then 1 level Exhaustion each failed save after that</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div><br></div><div><p data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\">When first taking drug, make a Con save to resist addiction.</p><p>Then if drug isn't taken again within the Satiation period, make another Con save. If failed, user is still addicted, and must take Withdrawal Effects.</p><p>Every day after that that the user continues to not take the drug, user must try to make the Con save again. If failed, continue Withdrawal Effects and try again next day.</p><p>If an addict succeeds on a save, they continue to take Withdrawal Effects and must make it another whole day and succeed on a 2nd save at a +3 DC! Only after succeeding this 2nd save are they cured of addiction. If 2nd save is failed, they start over and need 2 successive successes.</p><p></p><p><strong>OVERDOSE?</strong>&nbsp;If more than one dose is taken in a 24-hour period, the user could take effects like:</p><ul data-spread=\"false\"><li data-label=\"•\" data-list-type=\"bullet\" data-spread=\"false\"><p>immediately falls unconscious for 1d4 hours (Fort DC 18 negates).</p></li><li data-label=\"•\" data-list-type=\"bullet\" data-spread=\"false\"><p>takes 2d6 points of damage.</p></li><li data-label=\"•\" data-list-type=\"bullet\" data-spread=\"false\"><p>side effects doubled.</p></li><li data-label=\"•\" data-list-type=\"bullet\" data-spread=\"false\"><p>make a separate save (Con DC 25) or die in terrible pain.</p></li><li data-label=\"•\" data-list-type=\"bullet\" data-spread=\"false\"><p>paralyzes the user for 2d4 hours.</p></li><li data-label=\"•\" data-list-type=\"bullet\" data-spread=\"false\"><p>nauseated for 1d4 × 10 minutes</p></li><li data-label=\"•\" data-list-type=\"bullet\" data-spread=\"false\"><p>numbing stupor for 2d4 hours. The user can only take partial actions until the stupor wears off.</p></li><li data-label=\"•\" data-list-type=\"bullet\" data-spread=\"false\"><p>Disad on all of an Ability until long rest.</p></li><li data-label=\"•\" data-list-type=\"bullet\" data-spread=\"false\"><p>user becomes catatonic (Fort DC 15 negates).</p></li></ul><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div><br></div>",
